{
  "$comment": "Tend's design tokens: one source for Tend for Mac and the web dashboard. Values follow apps/tend-macos/Sources/TendTheme.swift and BrandMark.swift (checked by crates/tend/tests-js/design-tokens.test.mjs); system colours are NSColor/UIColor.system* sampled in sRGB on macOS 27.2 in the default appearance (the 26-series palette), and the accent is controlAccentColor's default blue (a user's own accent choice is not followed). Edit here, then run `node scripts/design-tokens.mjs` to regenerate crates/tend/src/dashboard/web/tokens.css and apps/shared/Sources/TendDesignTokens.swift (which TendTheme.swift reads).",
